stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft_form
  draft_form --> open: publish form and consent text
  open --> submitted: verified antiabuse submit
  submitted --> under_review: staff opens queue
  under_review --> needs_info: request clarification
  needs_info --> under_review: applicant update token
  under_review --> approved: authorized review
  under_review --> rejected: authorized review
  approved --> public_opt_in: explicit public listing permission
  public_opt_in --> published_profile: public profile published
  open --> closed: deadline / disable
  submitted --> withdrawn: applicant withdraws
  approved --> withdrawn: withdrawal processed
